(6074407, 894014, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very in your face! Like the idea behind the photo, but I don''t care for the overly contrast/sharp feel.</td>', 'Very in your face! Like the idea behind the photo, but I don''t care for the overly contrast/sharp feel.', '2010-06-30 12:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
