(6074412, 894026, 114225, '<td valign="top">Super cute photo. One suggestion I would have would be to crop a bit tighter, so maybe you couldn''t see the building the the background.</td>', 'Super cute photo. One suggestion I would have would be to crop a bit tighter, so maybe you couldn''t see the building the the background.', '2010-06-30 12:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074414, 894385, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good use of B&amp;W for this photo, I think it adds to the character. I like how you have a person walking through  the scene, brings interest to what would have likely been boring.</td>', 'I like it. Good use of B&W for this photo, I think it adds to the character. I like how you have a person walking through  the scene, brings interest to what would have likely been boring.', '2010-06-30 12:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074416, 894316, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oooh, looks like someone is about to charge! Great emotion and use of depth of field.</td>', 'Oooh, looks like someone is about to charge! Great emotion and use of depth of field.', '2010-06-30 12:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074417, 894210, 114225, '<td valign="top">You know, I do like the quirkiness of this photo. I could probably do without the halo effect around the cow, as it is distracting.</td>', 'You know, I do like the quirkiness of this photo. I could probably do without the halo effect around the cow, as it is distracting.', '2010-06-30 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074419, 893556, 114225, '<td valign="top">+1 for using the bad pun in the title :)<br/>I kind of wish you could have gotten the photo without the people in it (or cloned them out as it is an advanced challenge). They are definitely distracting me.</td>', '+1 for using the bad pun in the title :)I kind of wish you could have gotten the photo without the people in it (or cloned them out as it is an advanced challenge). They are definitely distracting me.', '2010-06-30 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074422, 894522, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of duo-tone to add extra interest to this photo (it helps to bring out the grassy details)</td>', 'Good use of duo-tone to add extra interest to this photo (it helps to bring out the grassy details)', '2010-06-30 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074424, 894147, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. You used good lighting for this, as it would be super easy to get way too many reflections. Unfortunately, there is a lot of noise in the photo that is taking away from it.</td>', 'Good attempt. You used good lighting for this, as it would be super easy to get way too many reflections. Unfortunately, there is a lot of noise in the photo that is taking away from it.', '2010-06-30 12:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074441, 894047, 100335, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea, i also like the fact that bulls represent market buyers and the color red represents selling :P so theres a meaning there as well beyond just the common misconception of bulls only see red. Very nice perspective and very Very nice idea. 8 from me.</td>', 'Awesome idea, i also like the fact that bulls represent market buyers and the color red represents selling :P so theres a meaning there as well beyond just the common misconception of bulls only see red. Very nice perspective and very Very nice idea. 8 from me.', '2010-06-30 13:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
