(6074531, 894147, 52549, '<td valign="top">Love this, you''ve done a great job here. I don''t know how your doing (with it not being a real animal) but I''m giving you a 7. Good luck.</td>', 'Love this, you''ve done a great job here. I don''t know how your doing (with it not being a real animal) but I''m giving you a 7. Good luck.', '2010-06-30 14:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
