(6078669, 894221, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a very static image. It has a lot of mid tones and not very many highlights or shadows making it somewhat dull in contrast. The centered composition and side on shot probably taken from a full standing position is fairly straight forward, but not too creative. It does have good focus which is a plus!</td>', 'This is a very static image. It has a lot of mid tones and not very many highlights or shadows making it somewhat dull in contrast. The centered composition and side on shot probably taken from a full standing position is fairly straight forward, but not too creative. It does have good focus which is a plus!', '2010-07-03 15:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6078673, 893621, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good shot! Nice color and even lighting. Just for observation purposes there seems to be a lot of chromatic aberation at the sky line... there is a large cyan line around the trees and at the horizon. Probably could have been fixed during post processing but it is not really detrimental to the image.</td>', 'Good shot! Nice color and even lighting. Just for observation purposes there seems to be a lot of chromatic aberation at the sky line... there is a large cyan line around the trees and at the horizon. Probably could have been fixed during post processing but it is not really detrimental to the image.', '2010-07-03 15:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
