(6078689, 894314, 10785, '<td valign="top">There''s always one person out there who has to push the limits of the challenge description. Bovinae, though part of the larger family of Bovidae, is strictly limited to cows, oxen, buffalo, yaks, etc... Goats and sheep are in the family of Caprinae under the Bovidae species. <br/> <br/>Anyway it''s a good photo but what is up with the background grasses in the bottom right corner?? Something weird going on there digitally.</td>', 'There''s always one person out there who has to push the limits of the challenge description. Bovinae, though part of the larger family of Bovidae, is strictly limited to cows, oxen, buffalo, yaks, etc... Goats and sheep are in the family of Caprinae under the Bovidae species.  Anyway it''s a good photo but what is up with the background grasses in the bottom right corner?? Something weird going on there digitally.', '2010-07-03 15:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
