(6098155, 894317, 52115, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this with just the one black-n-white cow.<br/>Great for a commercial or printed ad.<br/>Added: Also reminds me of some old record album cover, maybe by Pink Floyd.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-07-20 12:00:18.</i></td>', 'I would love to see this with just the one black-n-white cow.Great for a commercial or printed ad.Added: Also reminds me of some old record album cover, maybe by Pink Floyd.', '2010-07-20 12:59:16.000000', '2010-07-20 13:00:18.000000', 0),
(6109174, 894077, 40718, '<td valign="top">This shot actually has some promise.  I enjoy the color of the orange eartags as they stand out against the black and white of the cows.  I may have cropped the top a little tighter; somewhere between the top of the cows back and the top of her head.  Finally, do you sharpen your pictures at all with processing?  This shot looks a bit soft.  I don''t think it''s your lens since you had it stopped down to 5.6 and your shutter speed was likely fast enough.  Applying some USM would be helpful.  But your ability to see the promise of this shot was good.</td>', 'This shot actually has some promise.  I enjoy the color of the orange eartags as they stand out against the black and white of the cows.  I may have cropped the top a little tighter; somewhere between the top of the cows back and the top of her head.  Finally, do you sharpen your pictures at all with processing?  This shot looks a bit soft.  I don''t think it''s your lens since you had it stopped down to 5.6 and your shutter speed was likely fast enough.  Applying some USM would be helpful.  But your ability to see the promise of this shot was good.', '2010-07-30 01:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
